# Generated data.
#
# /data/* rather than /data/ : a bare `data/` pattern also matches kd/data/, which
# silently swallowed kd/data/prompts.py -- the module that builds the teacher
# prompts -- so `gen` and `smoke` died with ModuleNotFoundError and the file was
# never recoverable from git. Git also will not descend into a fully excluded
# directory, so the trace dump has to be re-included file by file.
/data/*
!/data/traces.jsonl
/artifacts/

# run logs and scratch
*.log
*.err
logs*.txt
/l.txt
/.freebuff/

# root-level eval dumps; the committed artifacts are under results/
/*.json
/examples/traces.jsonl
/run.log

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/

# modal auth lives in ~/.modal, but never risk a stray token
.env
*.token
